OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA largely dry and fine day to
OL,6,Fcome with some good spells of
OL,7,Fsunshine. A few showers will develop
OL,8,Fthough, especially towards the
OL,9,Fsouthwest during the afternoon.
OL,10,FFeeling pleasantly warm in the
OL,11,Fsunshine.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA dry evening to come for
OL,14,Fmost, with some late sunshine.
OL,15,FOvernight cloud will increase with
OL,16,Frain arriving, especially in the west.
OL,17,FWinds also increasing towards dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
