OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA rather cloudy, breezy and
OL,6,Fwet day, with the rain heaviest and
OL,7,Fmost persistent towards the north.
OL,8,FTemperatures near average, but rather
OL,9,Fcool in the more prolonged spells of
OL,10,Frain.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDrier
OL,13,Fand brighter on Thursday, before rain
OL,14,Farrives overnight. Rain may linger
OL,15,Finto Friday, before turning drier and
OL,16,Fbrighter again on Saturday. Feeling
OL,17,Fwarm in any brighter moments.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
